@baseUrl = http://localhost:8088/api/v1
@internalToken = local-worker-token
@orderNo = REPLACE_WITH_ORDER_NO

### Health
GET http://localhost:8088/health/ready

### Create order (repeat unchanged to verify idempotency)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-0001

{
  "customerRef": "CUST-001",
  "productCode": "DIAMOND-100",
  "playerUid": "99887766",
  "amount": "100.00"
}

### Invalid order number => 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/not-an-order

### Missing valid order => 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/ORD-2587965432159-458

### Current orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?tab=current&page=1&pageSize=20

### Historical orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?tab=history&page=1&pageSize=20

### Order detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderNo}}

### Timeline
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderNo}}/timeline

### Report issue
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderNo}}/report-issue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "issueType": "TOPUP_NOT_RECEIVED",
  "description": "Payment completed but the game balance has not changed."
}

### Claim queued order (run paid webhook first)
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/bots/claim
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Token: {{internalToken}}

{
  "workerId": "bot-01"
}

### Heartbeat
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/bots/heartbeat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Token: {{internalToken}}

{
  "workerId": "bot-01",
  "orderNo": "{{orderNo}}"
}

### Bot success (outcome also accepts transient_failure / permanent_failure)
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/orders/{{orderNo}}/result
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Token: {{internalToken}}

{
  "workerId": "bot-01",
  "outcome": "success",
  "errorCode": "",
  "message": "Provider confirmed top-up"
}

### Correct UID after permanent failure
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/internal/orders/{{orderNo}}/player-uid
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Token: {{internalToken}}

{
  "playerUid": "11223344"
}

### Manual idempotent maintenance run
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/maintenance/sweep
X-Internal-Token: {{internalToken}}

### Bank webhook
# Body signature is HMAC-SHA256 hex using local-bank-secret.
# PowerShell helper:
# $body='{"eventId":"bank-evt-001","orderNo":"YOUR_ORDER_NO","status":"paid"}'
# $h=[System.Security.Cryptography.HMACSHA256]::new([Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetBytes('local-bank-secret'))
# $sig=[Convert]::ToHexString($h.ComputeHash([Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetBytes($body))).ToLower()
# Invoke-RestMethod http://localhost:8088/api/v1/internal/bank/webhooks -Method Post -Headers @{'X-Internal-Token'='local-worker-token';'X-Webhook-Signature'=$sig} -ContentType application/json -Body $body

